      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start, it hits all the facts. \n\ni just ran it through our sentiment filter and the score came back a bit lower than i'd like. it's a little \"dry\" for what we need. i know i said not to go overboard, but can you try a version that's a bit more emotionally resonant? we really need to connect with people's hearts here so they feel the urgency. \n\njust please keep it professional—don't make it sound like a cheap infomercial. it just needs a bit more \"soul\" or \"warmth\" to bump that score up without losing our dignity. thanks!",
      "source": "evaluator"
